    "name": "What Affects the Cost of a Second-Story Addition in San Diego County?",
    "text": "What Affects the Cost of a Second-Story Addition in San Diego County?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "The cost of a second-story addition depends on the size and layout, structural reinforcement, design complexity, finish selections, utilities, site conditions, permit requirements, and the extent of work needed in the existing home. A useful quote should separate design, engineering, permitting, construction, allowances, and exclusions so you can compare providers on scope rather than a single headline number.",
